# Careers (/careers, /careers/apply) uses its OWN Supabase project, separate from
# the tResolv product. Use that project's URL and its anon/publishable key ONLY.
# Never put a service_role key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable: those ship to the browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CAREERS_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CAREERS_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
